## TASK 8 — Prediction Problem Definition

**Binary next-lap prediction:**

$$P(\text{PIT}_{t+1} \mid X_t) \in [0, 1]$$

$$P(\text{STAY}_{t+1} \mid X_t) = 1 - P(\text{PIT}_{t+1} \mid X_t)$$

**Input:** $X_t$ = feature vector from Tasks 5 and 6, available at lap t  
**Output:** calibrated probability, not a class label

**Scope of MVP:**
- Binary PIT/STAY only (no compound selection, no multi-lap forecasting)
- Applied to a single specified opponent driver at a time
- Called every lap during Monte Carlo rollout

