          4. Run SCRiskAdapter.build_H_t(state) → get_fcy_probabilities
          5. Compute derived features
          6. Look ahead to lap t+1 to get target
          7. Append row to dataset
    Save dataset for this race as parquet
Concatenate all race parquets → master dataset
